# Thinking1 ... Thinking2 builds a list. peepoMeasure gives its length.
PepoG xs Thinking1 3, 1, 4, 1, 5 Thinking2.
peepoChat xs.
peepoChat "length" peepoMeasure xs.

# index into a list with the same pair
peepoChat "first" xs Thinking1 0 Thinking2.
peepoChat "last" xs Thinking1 4 Thinking2.

# loops and lists go together
PepoG total 0.
peepoJuice PepoG i 0. peepoLessThan i peepoMeasure xs. peepoCookie i peepoFriendship i 1. Wokege
    peepoCookie total peepoFriendship total xs Thinking1 i Thinking2.
Bedge
peepoChat "total" total.

# nested lists work too
PepoG grid Thinking1 Thinking1 1, 2 Thinking2, Thinking1 3, 4 Thinking2 Thinking2.
peepoChat grid Thinking1 1 Thinking2 Thinking1 0 Thinking2.
